      chainId: 1
      vault: "0x1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678"
      newFee: "15"
    }
  ) {
    to
    from
    data
    value
    chainId
  }
}
3

Send the Transaction
Finally, send the transaction.

React
TypeScript
GraphQL
The response is a TransactionRequest that can be sent directly using the wallet associated with the 
from
 address.

TransactionRequest
